### Phase 8 — Temporal Analysis

#### [NEW] temporal_analysis.py

```
Functions:
├── estimate_pothole_age(mask, image_rgb, curvature_features)
│   - Compute edge_sharpness from curvature (high max_curvature = fresh)
│   - Compute boundary_regularity from curvature_sign_changes (high = old)
│   - Compute texture_around_boundary:
│     - Dilate mask, get surrounding ring
│     - Compute Gabor filter responses → crack texture score
│   - Compute depth_area_ratio from features
│   - Weighted scoring:
│     age_score = 0.4*inv(sharpness) + 0.3*irregularity + 0.2*crack_texture + 0.1*inv(depth_area_ratio)
│   - Map to categories:
│     score < 0.25 → "Fresh" (< 2 weeks)
│     score < 0.50 → "Developing" (2-8 weeks)
│     score < 0.75 → "Established" (2-6 months)
│     score >= 0.75 → "Chronic" (> 6 months)
│   - Return dict: {age_category, age_score, edge_sharpness, boundary_regularity, crack_texture_score}
│
├── predict_severity_progression(current_features, age_estimate, weather_context=None)
│   - Physics-informed model of pothole deterioration
│   - Base deterioration rate depends on current severity:
│     Shallow: slow (0.01/day), Moderate: medium (0.03/day), Deep: fast (0.06/day)
│   - Acceleration factor from age (older = faster deterioration)
│   - Weather multiplier: freeze_thaw=1.5, tropical_rain=1.3, dry=0.8
│   - Predict severity_score at +30, +60, +90 days
│   - Map predicted scores to severity categories
│   - Return: {
│       current_severity, current_score,
│       prediction_30d: {severity, score, confidence},
│       prediction_60d: {severity, score, confidence},
│       prediction_90d: {severity, score, confidence},
│       deterioration_rate, weather_factor
│     }
│
└── Integration with road_segment_analysis.py:
    - Import estimate_pothole_age in analyze_segment()
    - Factor age into repair_priority_score:
      Chronic potholes get 1.5× weight boost
      Fresh potholes get 0.8× weight
```

