#### Graceful Degradation Rules

```
Module failures handled:
├── curvature extraction fails → skip geometry features, use existing features only
├── water detection fails → omit waterAnalysis field, no error
├── DINOv2 not installed → foundation features silently skipped
├── geometry-only models not trained → /analyze/geometry returns 503 with message
├── SfS reconstruction fails → use Depth-Anything depth as-is
├── adverse_conditions.py import fails → augmentation skipped
└── IMU module not configured → no effect on any pipeline
```

